' Tour slide 8 — "What states can this occupy, and which transitions are legal?"
' State machine over the catalog side of the SAME course-registration territory:
' the lifecycle of a course proposal. Plan §S s8 + §D2(c).
'
' ==> REUSED VERBATIM on correspondence slide 26 ("One model, many implementations").
'     Visual identity between slide 8 and slide 26 is REQUIRED (plan §S s8 notes).
'     Place the SAME rendered PNG on both slides. Do not re-draw, re-theme or re-crop.
'
' Laid out 2 rows deep on purpose. A straight left-to-right chain of four states renders
' about 10:1, which projects too small to read; the snake holds the figure near 2.4:1 so a
' 9 in placement keeps every glyph above 20 pt AND still works as slide 26's top band.
@startuml
!include _theme.puml
hide empty description
skinparam nodesep 120
skinparam ranksep 70

[*] -right-> Draft
Draft -right-> Submitted : submit
Submitted -down-> Approved : approve
Approved -right-> Published : publish
Submitted --> Draft : revise
Published -right-> [*]
@enduml
